<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Galaxias de Catamarca</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
html,body{width:100%;height:100%;background:#000008;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Georgia',serif;}
.wrap{text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:32px;}
h1{font-size:clamp(20px,4vw,32px);letter-spacing:0.2em;color:rgba(180,220,255,0.85);text-transform:uppercase;}
p{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.25em;color:rgba(120,170,255,0.4);text-transform:uppercase;}
.links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:280px;}
a{display:block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(60,100,200,0.35);border-radius:10px;
  color:rgba(160,210,255,0.8);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.18em;
  background:rgba(10,25,70,0.4);transition:all 0.2s;text-align:center;}
a:hover{background:rgba(20,50,140,0.5);border-color:rgba(100,160,255,0.5);}
.stars{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.4em;color:rgba(140,190,255,0.2);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="stars">✦ ✦ ✦</div>
  <h1>Galaxias<br>de Catamarca</h1>
  <p>Sistema interactivo · Tecnoincas</p>
  <div class="links">
    <a href="/main.html">🖥 Pantalla principal (proyector)</a>
    <a href="/usuario.html">📱 Celular del visitante</a>
    <a href="/control.html">⚙️ Panel de control</a>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
